  m_text: "<size=120%><b>FLIGHT & SCRIPTING</b></size>\nSaccFlightAndVehicles - Sacchan-VRC
    (MIT License)\nUdonSharp - MerlinVR (MIT License)\nYamaPlayer - kwxxw (yamadev)\nVRChat
    SDK - VRChat Inc.\n\n<size=120%><b>3D MODELS</b></size>\nCVN-30 Aurelith (carrier)
    - \u8056\u91CD\u5DE5\u696D (HZI)\nF/A-18 - Pit-bool\nAircraft Support Set / Deck
    Crew Set / Podium Set / MLCC - ERIOHS ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL (EEI)\nPOLYGON Military
    / POLYGON Generic - Synty Studios\nSSY Airplane Missile Set - studio symphony\nArchangel
    (air fortress) - TUBUBAM TECH\nLow Poly Military Warship Collection 10 - JC Team\nLow
    Poly Military Vehicles Package - Hipernt\nCartoon Military Model Pack - GAPH\nMecha
    Bullet Effects (\u30E1\u30AB\u5F3E\u30A8\u30D5\u30A7\u30AF\u30C8) - \u8D85\u5175\u5668\u5DE5\u623F\nSA-15
    / ZSU-23 / S-60 / rocket models - 5Sori\n\n<size=120%><b>MUSIC</b></size> <size=80%>(streamed
    from YouTube, not included in this world)</size>\nACE COMBAT series soundtracks
    - BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Inc.\n\n<size=120%><b>VOICE & SOUND</b></size>\nRadio
    voices and some sound effects - ElevenLabs\nThunder - BigSoundBank, Joseph SARDIN
    & Axeline T. (CC0)\n\n<size=120%><b>FONTS</b></size> <size=80%>(SIL Open Font
    License)</size>\nPretendard / Pretendard JP - Kil Hyung-jin, Black Ops One -
    Sorkin Type Co,\nZen Maru Gothic, Liberation Sans\n\n<size=120%><b>MADE FOR THIS
    WORLD</b></size>\nPlanning, design & testing - 5Sori\nBuilt with Claude (Anthropic):\nLUNA,
    SHADE, XF-W, laser ace, Lance battery, land ship, submarine, drones,\nTEL, weapon
    pods, ship interior, cities & terrain props,\nocean / cloud / terrain shaders,
    HUD & icons, synthesized sound effects,\nmission, boss & AI scripts\n\n<size=80%><color=#88AA99>Assets
    marked CC0 need no credit but are listed with thanks.</color></size>\n"
